                        <seg type="script">Careful.</seg>
                        <seg type="ink">Black, red.</seg>
                        <date>First half of the 20th century.</date>
                        <seg type="rubrication">Holy names; name of the donors; name of the
                           Metropolitan; incipit of Text I; incipit of the prayers to be read;
                           directives to the ministers; elements of the punctuation signs; elements
                           of Ethiopic numerals. 
 On the incipit page of Text I (fol. 3r), a
                           few lines are rubricated (alternating with black lines).</seg>
                     </handNote>
